OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry but
OL,6,Fcloudy evening for many. A band of
OL,7,Fheavy rain pushes in from the west
OL,8,Fovernight clearing most of the region
OL,9,Fby dawn. Strong winds strengthen
OL,10,Ffurther during the night, reaching
OL,11,Fgale force in exposed areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,14,Fisolated, but occasionally heavy
OL,15,Fshowers and plenty of sunny spells.
OL,16,FFeeling fresh in the strong breeze,
OL,17,Fthis easing through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
