OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fshowery start to Wednesday before
OL,7,Fturning drier and brighter by
OL,8,Fafternoon. Sunny spells and light
OL,9,Fwinds Thursday, before cloud starts to
OL,10,Fbuild again Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
